{"product_id":"lx1-7ah-battery-pack","title":"LX1 Long-Shift Power Bank","description":"\u003cdiv aria-setsize=\"-1\" id=\"message-list_1776450854.717129\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv aria-roledescription=\"message\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003eThe LX1 Long-Shift 7000 mAh battery Power Bank is engineered to keep your team running even in harsh conditions. Designed for durability, it performs reliably in extreme temperatures ranging from -20°C (-4°F) to 45°C (113°F). It features a convenient slide-and-snap mounting system for quick, secure attachment to your LX1 smart glasses. Delivering dependable, all-shift power, it’s the ideal solution for warehouse teams and field technicians who need uninterrupted performance wherever the job takes them.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Vuzix Corporation","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":56389773492390,"sku":"516T0A001","price":119.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/files\/DSC00370_c24e3a9f-de05-4b42-abf8-87c858b9977b.jpg?v=1776347790","url":"https:\/\/www.vuzix.com\/products\/lx1-7ah-battery-pack","provider":"Vuzix Corporation","version":"1.0","type":"link"}